<title>HONG KONG: Egana Int'l interim net rises 55.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Egana Int'l interim net rises 55.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.3	  vs 4.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5	  vs 1.6</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  20.86 gain vs 3.73 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    63.22	vs 40.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		     556.45     vs 505.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 Egana International (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 14-16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Egana International is a quartz watch distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on realising its portfolio investment in Peace Mark (Holdings) Ltd and legal interest compensation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
